  "intro": {
    "title": "Am Abend, in der Nacht",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Morgen, Vormittag, Mittag, Nachmittag, Abend: all masculine, all with am (am Abend). Nacht is the odd one: die Nacht, in der Nacht.",
      "Like the days, add -s and a small letter for a habit: morgens, abends, nachts. And keep der Morgen (the morning) apart from morgen (tomorrow): morgen früh is tomorrow morning."
    ]
  },
